WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:05.705
I believe that this nation
should commit itself

00:00:05.738 --> 00:00:07.306
to landing a man on the moon

00:00:07.339 --> 00:00:10.710
and returning him safely
to the earth.

00:00:10.743 --> 00:00:14.313
After thousands of years
gazing up in the heavens

00:00:14.346 --> 00:00:16.382
and dreaming of this day,

00:00:16.415 --> 00:00:20.520
a man is about to set foot
on the moon.

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:24.590
Across the world,
people wait with bated breath.

00:00:24.623 --> 00:00:28.528
Ladies and gentleman,
this is a live signal.

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:30.797
There he is!

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:35.068
The shock across the nation
at this event

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:37.537
is just indescribable.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:42.341
♪ Music playing ♪

00:00:42.374 --> 00:00:44.477
The Soviet cosmonaut

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:49.148
has become the first
to set foot on the moon.

00:00:49.181 --> 00:00:53.519 align:start size:3% position:97% line:0%
♪

00:00:53.552 --> 00:00:56.122
We thought it was about
being first.

00:00:56.155 --> 00:00:59.358
Turns out the stakes
are much bigger than that.

00:00:59.391 --> 00:01:02.595
Get back to work.

00:01:02.628 --> 00:01:04.530
We're still in this thing!

00:01:04.563 --> 00:01:06.099
Change of plans, gentleman.

00:01:06.132 --> 00:01:08.101
There is water on the moon.

00:01:08.134 --> 00:01:10.470
This race
will be ours to fight for...

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:12.438
[ENGINE REVS]

00:01:12.471 --> 00:01:14.740
...and to win.

00:01:14.773 --> 00:01:16.542
And we are not stopping there.

00:01:16.575 --> 00:01:19.245
Moon lab.
We need to accelerate the base.

00:01:19.278 --> 00:01:21.447
You're going to be
an astronaut candidate.

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:24.684
No, I'm going to be
an astronaut.

00:01:24.717 --> 00:01:26.853
We're going to Mars. Saturn.

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:29.388
The stars. The galaxy.

00:01:29.421 --> 00:01:32.725
Drifting right. Watch it!

00:01:32.758 --> 00:01:34.627
Eagle, this is Houston,
do you copy?

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:39.198 align:start size:3% position:97% line:0%
♪

00:01:39.231 --> 00:01:41.767
This is not the end of the race!

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:46.639
We must keep our eyes
to the future.

00:01:46.672 --> 00:01:48.841
Three... Two...

00:01:48.874 --> 00:01:53.279 align:start size:3% position:97% line:0%
♪

00:01:53.312 --> 00:01:55.315
[RADIO STATIC]

